    "created_at": "2016-10-11T17:13:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-11T17:13:13Z",
    "body": "Sure, agreed on the double brackets, but we also have `isTrusted`, `source`, etc. Would we turn those into terms of art too?\n\n(And the main reason DOM doesn't define these as concepts at the moment is that I'd much rather have IDL do this automatically as internal slots (whatever the notation). Otherwise each new event basically needs a bunch of boilerplate to define its concepts and all the \"automagic\" language we have around the constructor would become way more involved or break down.)\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
